  "plain": "A man named Dan Howe is said to have vouched for Dan Sherman, a man who has told of working in a secret program and whose account came up under the name Project Preserve Destiny. According to the online UFO researcher who goes by UAPGerb, Howe sat him down at a gathering and spoke for a long time about how Sherman's description of ELINT, short for electronic intelligence, meaning the gathering of signals from radar and other electronic systems, was \"just beautifully on the money.\" UAPGerb tells this on the podcast as something Howe told him in person, and if Howe is right, Sherman's insider account fits how such systems really work."
